spriteloom-mlx

Based on SpriteLoom, created by Valentyn Karachevtsev (vkarach).
Original project: https://github.com/vkarach/spriteloom
Original license: Apache License 2.0 (retained in LICENSE).

The original project provides the application, prompts, pixel-art processing,
WebSocket protocol, and Aseprite extension. This independent repository adds
MLX inference, masked denoising, macOS integration, and a shared local service.
The retained source history identifies the upstream code and later changes.

MFLUX provides the MLX FLUX.2 implementation under its MIT license.
Black Forest Labs supplies FLUX.2 Klein 4B weights under Apache License 2.0.
Model weights are downloaded at setup time and are not included here.

No endorsement by the original creator or model providers is claimed.
